<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>NovaCart – Shop Smart. Live Better.</title>
 https://abdullah328678-arch.github.io/tasveeb-novestores/
<meta name="description" content="NovaCart is an online store for smart gadgets, fashion, home essentials, beauty, accessories and fitness gear. Shop Smart. Live Better.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--navy:#0B1F3A;--navy2:#13335C;--orange:#F26B21;--orange2:#D95A14;--ink:#1B2433;--mute:#5B6678;--mist:#F3F6FA;--line:#E3E8EF;--white:#fff}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:"Source Sans 3",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.6;font-size:17px}
h1,h2,h3,h4,.logo{font-family:Sora,system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.2}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img,svg{max-width:100%}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange);outline-offset:2px}
.wrap{width:100%;padding:0 clamp(16px,4vw,64px)}
.sec{padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) 0}
.sec h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:10px}
.sub{color:var(--mute);max-width:640px;margin-bottom:36px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;transition:.2s;font-size:16px}
.btn.pri{background:var(--orange);color:#fff}.btn.pri:hover{background:var(--orange2)}
.btn.ghost{border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);color:#fff}.btn.ghost:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--navy)}
.btn.dark{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.btn.dark:hover{background:var(--navy2)}
/* announcement */
.ann{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px}
/* header: one line */
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.hd{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;height:72px;flex-wrap:nowrap}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:var(--navy);white-space:nowrap}
.logo i{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--navy);display:grid;place-items:center}
.logo b{color:var(--orange)}
nav{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:8px}
nav a{padding:8px 11px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}
nav a:hover{background:var(--mist);color:var(--orange)}
.search{flex:1;min-width:120px;max-width:340px;margin-left:auto;position:relative}
.search input{width:100%;height:42px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:0 14px 0 40px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;background:var(--mist)}
.search input:focus{border-color:var(--orange);background:#fff;outline:0}
.search svg{position:absolute;left:12px;top:11px}
.ic{position:relative;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
.ic:hover{background:var(--mist)}
.cnt{position:absolute;top:2px;right:0;min-width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0 4px}
.burger{display:none}
@media(max-width:1180px){nav{display:none;position:absolute;top:72px;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;flex-direction:column;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(11,31,58,.08)}nav.open{display:flex}nav a{padding:14px 10px}.burger{display:grid}}
@media(max-width:560px){.search{display:none}.hd{gap:6px}.logo{margin-right:auto}}
/* hero */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--navy) 0%,var(--navy2) 100%);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-120px;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--orange);opacity:.14}
.hg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) 0;position:relative}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,60px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:18px}
.hero p.lead{font-size:19px;color:#C9D6E8;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:28px}
.intro{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-left:4px solid var(--orange);padding:14px 18px;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;color:#DCE6F3;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:30px;max-width:600px}
.intro a{color:#FFB88F;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.intro a:hover{color:#fff}
.hb{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.hv div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:20px;padding:26px 20px;text-align:center}
.hv div:nth-child(2){transform:translateY(24px);background:var(--orange)}
.hv div:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-8px)}
.hv span{font-size:54px;display:block}.hv small{font-weight:600;font-size:15px}
@media(max-width:900px){.hg{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.sl{position:relative;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);border:4px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);aspect-ratio:4/5;max-height:600px;width:100%;max-width:480px;margin-left:auto;background:var(--navy2)}
.st,.sd{position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0}
.sd{opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s}.sd.on{opacity:1}
.sd img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 20%}
.sd figcaption{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:48px 22px 22px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(7,21,41,.9));display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:#fff}
.sd figcaption b{font-family:Sora;font-size:18px;flex:1}.sd figcaption em{font-style:normal;font-family:Sora;font-weight:800;font-size:26px;color:#FFB88F}
.sb{background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px}
.sn{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);color:var(--navy);font-size:26px;line-height:1;z-index:2}
.sn:hover{background:var(--orange);color:#fff}.pv{left:12px}.nx{right:12px}
.dots{position:absolute;top:14px;left:0;right:0;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;z-index:2}
.dots button{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}.dots button.on{background:var(--orange);width:26px;border-radius:6px}
.pi img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 25%}
.pi{overflow:hidden}.sale{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;z-index:1}
@media(max-width:900px){.sl{margin:0 auto}}
/* categories */
.cats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:18px}
.cat{background:var(--mist);border-radius:18px;padding:28px 16px;text-align:center;transition:.2s;border:1px solid transparent}
.cat:hover{background:#fff;border-color:var(--orange);box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(11,31,58,.1);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.cat span{font-size:44px;display:block;margin-bottom:10px}
.cat h3{font-size:15px;color:var(--navy)}
.cat small{color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:1100px){.cats{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:560px){.cats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
/* products */
.bar{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;margin-bottom:28px;background:var(--mist);padding:16px;border-radius:16px}
.bar label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--mute);gap:4px}
.bar select,.bar input{height:42px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:0 12px;font:inherit;background:#fff;min-width:130px}
.bar input[type=number]{min-width:90px;width:90px}
.res{margin-left:auto;color:var(--mute);font-size:15px;align-self:center}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:22px}
.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.2s}
.card:hover{box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(11,31,58,.12);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.pi{height:190px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:76px;position:relative}
.wl{position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.12);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:18px}
.wl.on{color:#E0245E}
.pb{padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;flex:1}
.pc{font-size:13px;color:var(--orange2);font-weight:700}
.pb h3{font-size:16px;color:var(--navy)}
.pb p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mute);flex:1}
.pr{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px}
.pr b{font-family:Sora;font-size:20px;color:var(--navy)}
.add{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
.add:hover{background:var(--orange)}
.more{text-align:center;margin-top:32px}
/* offer */
.offer{background:var(--orange);color:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.offer h2{color:#fff;margin:0 0 8px}.offer p{max-width:560px;color:#FFEBDD}
.offer .btn{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
/* why */
.why{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px}
.wb{padding:28px 22px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.wb i{font-style:normal;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--navy);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px}
.wb h3{font-size:18px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px}.wb p{color:var(--mute);font-size:16px}
@media(max-width:1000px){.why{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:560px){.why{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
/* reviews */
.rv{background:var(--mist)}
.rg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.rc{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:26px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.tag{display:inline-block;background:#FFF1E8;color:var(--orange2);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:14px}
.rc p{margin-bottom:14px}.rc b{color:var(--navy)}
@media(max-width:900px){.rg{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
/* newsletter */
.nl{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;text-align:center}
.nl h2{color:#fff}.nl .sub{margin:0 auto 26px;color:#C9D6E8}
.nf{display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.nf input{flex:1;min-width:220px;height:50px;border-radius:12px;border:0;padding:0 16px;font:inherit}
.nf button{height:50px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-weight:700}
#nlm{margin-top:14px;min-height:24px;color:#FFB88F}
/* footer */
footer{background:#071529;color:#B8C4D6;padding-top:64px}
.fg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1.3fr;gap:36px;padding-bottom:44px}
footer h4{color:#fff;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
footer li{list-style:none;margin-bottom:9px;font-size:15px}
footer a:hover{color:var(--orange)}
footer .logo{color:#fff;margin-bottom:14px}
.soc{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.soc a{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);display:grid;place-items:center;transition:.2s}
.soc a:hover{background:var(--orange);color:#fff}
.fb{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);padding:20px 0;font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
@media(max-width:1000px){.fg{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.fg{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
/* cart drawer */
.ov{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(7,21,41,.55);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.25s;z-index:90}
.ov.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.dr{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:min(440px,100%);background:#fff;z-index:100;transform:translateX(100%);transition:.3s;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.dr.on{transform:none}
.dh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.dh h3{color:var(--navy)}
.db{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:16px 20px}
.ci{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.ci span.e{font-size:34px;background:var(--mist);border-radius:12px;text-align:center}
.ci h4{font-size:15px;color:var(--navy)}.ci small{color:var(--mute)}
.q{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:4px}
.q button{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--mist);font-weight:700}
.rm{color:#C0392B;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.df{padding:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.df .t{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:Sora;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px}
.df p{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin-bottom:14px}
.df .btn{width:100%;text-align:center}
.empty{text-align:center;color:var(--mute);padding:48px 0}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(80px);background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:12px;z-index:120;transition:.3s;font-weight:600}
.toast.on{transform:translateX(-50%)}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="ann">Welcome to NovaCart – Discover Amazing Products at Great Prices!</div>

<header>
<div class="wrap hd">
  <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="NovaCart home"><i><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 4h2.5l2.2 10.2a1 1 0 0 0 1 .8h8.6a1 1 0 0 0 1-.8L20 8H6.2"/><circle cx="9.5" cy="19" r="1.4" fill="#F26B21" stroke="none"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.4" fill="#F26B21" stroke="none"/></svg></i>Nova<b>Cart</b></a>
  <nav id="nav" aria-label="Main">
    <a href="#top">Home</a><a href="#shop" data-c="all">Shop</a><a href="#shop" data-c="0">Electronics</a><a href="#shop" data-c="1">Fashion</a><a href="#shop" data-c="2">Home &amp; Living</a><a href="#shop" data-c="4">Accessories</a><a href="#deals">Deals</a><a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="search"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5B6678" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg><input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search products" aria-label="Search products"></div>
  <a class="ic" href="#contact" aria-label="Account"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B1F3A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c1-4 4-6 8-6s7 2 8 6"/></svg></a>
  <button class="ic" id="wlb" aria-label="Wishlist"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B1F3A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20s-8-5-8-11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8-2.8A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 20 9c0 6-8 11-8 11z"/></svg><span class="cnt" id="wc">0</span></button>
  <button class="ic" id="cb" aria-label="Open cart"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B1F3A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 4h2.5l2.2 10.2a1 1 0 0 0 1 .8h8.6a1 1 0 0 0 1-.8L20 8H6.2"/><circle cx="9.5" cy="19" r="1.2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.2"/></svg><span class="cnt" id="cc">0</span></button>
  <button class="ic burger" id="bg" aria-label="Menu"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B1F3A" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg></button>
</div>
</header>

<main id="top">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hg">
    <div>
      <h1>Discover Products That Make Life Better</h1>
      <p class="intro">Looking for share allotment updates from Nepal while you browse? You can check them at <a href="https://iporesult.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">iporesult.cdsc.com.np nepal</a>, then come back to explore everything NovaCart has to offer.</p>
      <p class="lead">Explore our carefully selected collection of everyday essentials, smart gadgets, fashion accessories, and lifestyle products.</p>
      <div class="hb"><a class="btn pri" href="#shop">Shop Now</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#collections">Explore Collections</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sl" id="sl" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Featured sale">
      <div class="st">
        <figure class="sd on"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Model wearing a white formal shirt and maroon striped tie"><figcaption><span class="sb">Sale</span><b>White Formal Shirt</b><em>$100</em></figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="sd"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Model in a white formal shirt taking a mirror photo"><figcaption><span class="sb">Sale</span><b>Classic Formal Look</b><em>$100</em></figcaption></figure>
      </div>
      <button class="sn pv" aria-label="Previous slide">‹</button><button class="sn nx" aria-label="Next slide">›</button>
      <div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="collections"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Featured Categories</h2><p class="sub">Browse six collections built around the way you live, work and unwind.</p>
  <div class="cats" id="cats"></div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Featured Products</h2><p class="sub">Eight popular picks from our starter catalogue.</p>
  <div class="grid" id="feat"></div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" id="deals" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="offer"><div><h2>Upgrade Your Everyday Shopping Experience</h2><p>Find sample offers across electronics, fashion, home and fitness. Final prices, discounts and availability are confirmed by the store at checkout.</p></div><a class="btn" href="#shop">Shop Deals</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" id="shop" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Shop All Products</h2><p class="sub">Search, filter and sort all 31 products. Stock and availability are not confirmed until inventory and suppliers are connected.</p>
  <div class="bar">
    <label>Category<select id="fc"></select></label>
    <label>Min price ($)<input id="mn" type="number" min="0" placeholder="0"></label>
    <label>Max price ($)<input id="mx" type="number" min="0" placeholder="100"></label>
    <label>Sort by<select id="so"><option value="pop">Popularity</option><option value="new">Newest Products</option><option value="lo">Price: Low to High</option><option value="hi">Price: High to Low</option></select></label>
    <span class="res" id="rs"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="grid" id="all"></div>
  <div class="more"><button class="btn dark" id="lm">Load More</button></div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Why Shop With NovaCart?</h2><p class="sub">A simple, honest shopping experience from first click to checkout.</p>
  <div class="why">
    <div class="wb"><i>✨</i><h3>Carefully Selected Products</h3><p>Every item is chosen for usefulness, quality and value, with clear descriptions and no filler.</p></div>
    <div class="wb"><i>🛒</i><h3>Easy Shopping Experience</h3><p>Search, filter, save favourites and manage your cart without leaving the page.</p></div>
    <div class="wb"><i>🔒</i><h3>Secure Payment Options</h3><p>Payments go through providers such as Stripe or PayPal once the store owner connects them.</p></div>
    <div class="wb"><i>💬</i><h3>Helpful Customer Support</h3><p>Questions about orders or products are answered through the contact details below.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec rv"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Customer Reviews</h2><p class="sub">These are sample demonstration reviews showing the layout. They are not real customer experiences and will be replaced as genuine reviews are collected.</p>
  <div class="rg">
    <div class="rc"><span class="tag">Sample demonstration review</span><p>“Placeholder text showing how a review about sound quality and comfort will appear here.”</p><b>Sample Customer A</b></div>
    <div class="rc"><span class="tag">Sample demonstration review</span><p>“Placeholder text showing how a review about fit, fabric and everyday wear will appear here.”</p><b>Sample Customer B</b></div>
    <div class="rc"><span class="tag">Sample demonstration review</span><p>“Placeholder text showing how a review about home décor and packaging will appear here.”</p><b>Sample Customer C</b></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec nl"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Stay Updated with NovaCart</h2><p class="sub">Get product news and offers by email. Unsubscribe any time.</p>
  <form class="nf" id="nf" data-endpoint="" novalidate><input id="ne" type="email" placeholder="Your email address" aria-label="Email address" required><button type="submit">Subscribe</button></form>
  <div id="nlm" role="status"></div>
</div></section>
</main>

<footer id="contact"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="fg">
